            <title>基于Hugo&#43;Ngnix的静态个人博客搭建记录</title>
            <link>http://localhost:1313/p/%E5%9F%BA%E4%BA%8Ehugo-ngnix%E7%9A%84%E9%9D%99%E6%80%81%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E5%8D%9A%E5%AE%A2%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95/</link>
